@ELearning.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5277

### La contraseña de las cuentas demo sale de `DevSeed:Password` (user-secrets) y
### no se versiona. Definila en un `.env` local (gitignorado) así:
###   DEV_SEED_PASSWORD=<tu-password>
@password = {{$dotenv DEV_SEED_PASSWORD}}

GET {{ELearning.API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{ELearning.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-type: application/json

{
  "Email": "student@elearning.com",
  "Password": "{{password}}"
}

###

POST {{ELearning.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Accept: application/json
Content-type: application/json

{
  "Email": "instructor@elearning.com",
  "Password": "{{password}}"
}

